  'partners.sharingHint': { en: 'Tick nothing to share everything this partner follows. Ticking narrows it to the projects ticked.', rw: 'Ntugire icyo uhitamo kugira ngo usangize ibyo uyu mufatanyabikorwa akurikira byose. Guhitamo bigabanya ku mishinga yahiswemo.', fr: 'Ne cochez rien pour partager tout ce que suit ce partenaire. Cocher limite le partage aux projets cochés.', sw: 'Usichague chochote ili kushirikisha kila kitu anachofuatilia mshirika huyu. Kuchagua kunapunguza kwa miradi iliyochaguliwa.' },
