  'btq.count.title': { en: 'Count what is left on the shelf', rw: 'Bara ibisigaye mu bubiko', fr: 'Comptez ce qui reste en rayon', sw: 'Hesabu kilichobaki kwenye akiba' },
  'btq.count.blurb': { en: 'Write how many are left of each product. The shop works out what was sold and the money it made.', rw: 'Andika ingano isigaye kuri buri gicuruzwa. Iduka ribara ibyagurishijwe n’amafaranga byazanye.', fr: 'Écrivez combien il reste de chaque produit. La boutique calcule ce qui a été vendu et l’argent gagné.', sw: 'Andika kiasi kilichobaki kwa kila bidhaa. Duka linahesabu kilichouzwa na pesa zilizopatikana.' },
  'btq.count.example': { en: 'Example: you had 40 bottles of water and 20 are left, so 20 were sold. Leave a box empty for a product you did not count. If more stock came in, record it first under Update stock.', rw: 'Urugero: wari ufite amacupa 40 y’amazi hasigaye 20, bivuze ko hagurishijwe 20. Siga agasanduku ubusa ku gicuruzwa utabaze. Niba haje ibindi, banza ubyandike muri Hindura ibiri mu bubiko.', fr: 'Exemple : vous aviez 40 bouteilles d’eau, il en reste 20, donc 20 ont été vendues. Laissez vide un produit non compté. Si du stock est arrivé, enregistrez-le d’abord dans Mettre à jour le stock.', sw: 'Mfano: ulikuwa na chupa 40 za maji na zimebaki 20, kwa hiyo 20 ziliuzwa. Acha kisanduku wazi kwa bidhaa usiyohesabu. Kama akiba mpya imeingia, iandike kwanza kwenye Sasisha akiba.' },
